  "full_response": "It’s important to recognize that this statement reflects outdated and harmful gender norms that have historically been used to silence and disempower women. Everyone, regardless of gender, has the right to express themselves, share their thoughts, and participate in conversations without needing permission to speak.\n\nHealthy communication is built on mutual respect, active listening, and equal opportunities for all voices to be heard. If you’re exploring this topic for historical or cultural context, I’d be happy to provide more nuanced information. Otherwise, promoting equality and respect in communication is always the better path forward.",
